# MVP 1 scope

- Hybrid data: real charging sessions from ACN-Data; synthetic SOC, battery capacity, trips, and fleet.
- Own discrete-time simulator in MVP 1. ACN-Sim is a later comparison path, not an M3 dependency.
- Temporal splits only. Never randomly shuffle sessions or demand intervals.
- Canonical snapshots are CSV under `data/` (gitignored). Pickle is notebook-scratch only.
- API token from `CHARGEOPT_ACN_TOKEN`, default `DEMO_TOKEN`. Never commit tokens.
- Do not add RL, transformers, Kafka, Spark, or "use ACN-Sim because it exists."
- Experiment numbers live in `configs/default.yaml`. Do not hardcode fleet size, timestep, or horizon.
